exports[`git.branch.rebase journey given: [journey6] zero-commit branch whose remote holds a commit this tree lacks when: [t0] git.branch.rebase begin --mode apply then: it refuses as a constraint and names the pull 1`] = `
"🐢 hold up dude...

🐚 git.branch.rebase begin
   └─ ✋ ConstraintError: origin/feature/remote-ahead holds commits this tree lacks: 1

🥥 did you know?
   ├─ a fast-forward onto main would orphan them; pull them in first
   └─ git pull --ff-only origin feature/remote-ahead
"
`;

